		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A huge brass statue that wields a brass falchion and breathes out smoky cinders.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 19, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +8 (2d8) or 1 cinder breath, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cinder Breath</strong>. All within near, CON 15+ or 2d8 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources. Healed by fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Self-Destruct</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, explodes in fiery near- sized cube centered on golem. DEX 12+ or 2d8 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
